@node page1 "Introduction Dre! Page v1.1"

                         · [ · INTRODUCTION · ] ·

Dre! Page is at least one of the best and fastest Pager`s for Ami-Express.
Some new features are included.

If you have an A4ooo or A12oo and the Door doesn`t work so Call my BBS under
49 (0) 2131 275756 or 575634 for an uncompiled and registered Version!

Also call for some good ideas for another Doors or some Special Private
Doors for your own BBS.

But now enjoy this really fine door...
      
  [-Dr.Dre!/tRSi]  

@endnode
@node page2 "Requirements"

                         · [ · REQUIREMENTS · ] ·

All what you need is any Model of an AMIGA OS2.o or higher!
AmiExpress 2.xx - 3.xx

That all...
@endnode
@node page3 "INSTALLATION"

                         · [ · INSTALLATION · ] ·

Unpack the Archive TRSI-DP.Lha to your RAM Disk.
Create a Directory in your Doors: called Pager.
Then copy all files from the bbs/doors/Pager/ Directory into your
Doors:Pager/ Directory.
There are 3 txtfiles available...

ChatOn.txt  - This Text will be displayed if the Chatflag is ON  !!!
ChatOff.txt - This Text will be displayed if the Chatflag is OFF !!!
Chatno.txt  - This Text will be displayed if a User have paged more
              then allowed...

A User with Level 100 or lower can Page you only 3 Times...
If he try to page further, he will see a nice Text (Chatno.txt) which
you can configure yourself...
Also he will alltimes see how many Pages are left.

For Users with Level 100 or higher is it possible to page 10 Times.

The Pager will alltimes write the Chat Reason into your Callerslog.
If no Callerslog exists, the Pager will not create one...

@Endnode

